# --- Media -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Audio narrations live in R2, not git. 59 MB of MP3s that change rarely have no
# business in every clone and every CI checkout. `npm run media:push` uploads
# them; PUBLIC_MEDIA_BASE points the site at the bucket.
# Hero images ARE tracked: they are needed for every page render and for social
# cards, they are small enough to be worth the convenience, and a missing hero
# is a visible defect rather than a degraded extra.
public/media/audio/
